id: mighty-explosive-wave
name: Mighty Explosive Wave
advancement: true
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score of 8+
tpCost: 10
# "If you win the Might Clash against a Character for the effects of Explosive Wave, reduce that Character's Life Points
# by 1/2 of your Might."
waveDamage: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Each one it pushes loses 1/2 of your Might in Life Points.
text: >
  Mighty Explosive Wave: The force of your energy shoving away your foes also damages them.
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score of 8+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: If you win the Might Clash against a Character for the effects of Explosive Wave, reduce that Character’s Life
  Points by 1/2 of your Might.
